#
# **Nothing on this machine implements SLH-DSA.** python-cryptography 46
# does not have it and OpenSSL added it in 3.5, where this container has
# 3.0. These numbers are therefore the whole of the independent
# opinion rather than a supplement to one, which is why each section
# header carries its count and the reader asserts it.
#
# A section is `[mode parameterSet count]`, where the mode carries the
# signing variant: sigGen-internal-deterministic and -hedged produce
# different signatures from the same key and message, so they are
# different sections.
#
# **A sigGen signature is not stored whole.** Each case carries its
# length, its first 256 bytes, and the SHA-256 of all of it. For a
# deterministic signature there is one right answer, so a matching
# digest proves byte-for-byte equality; the prefix is kept so that a
# mismatch says roughly where. Storing all 72 groups in full would be
# 4.4 MB, ten times the largest vector file in this repository.

